//                         variants won't lift into named variant components cleanly.
//
//   OrderOverrideFieldsSchema  — z.instance(Money/...) fields serialize as {} in
//                                io:'input' (unrepresentable transform), making the
//                                generated schema useless for SDK consumers.
//
//   ProductCostOptionValueSchema — z.historical with z.instance(ProductCostOptionItem)
//                                  → top-level refine + unrepresentable instance fields
